#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The existing content-change review, unchanged, of the author's branch: its PR lists the PC refs it answers, and its staging preview is the after side of every deep link. A change the reviewers send back returns to the author inside that process."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:72
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "The one lane that decides. Every decision carries one of five codes and, for every code but accepted, a reason the commenter is owed. A decision that does not change the document ends here."
