#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Turns each returned row, form response or cited passage into one comment and resolves its anchor through the review version's page/line map. A citation that resolves to nothing is kept as unplaced, never dropped."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/public-comment.bpmn:84
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Where the author's edit is reviewed and lands: the feature branch's staging preview gives before/after deep links to each comment's anchor, the change set is reviewed as any content change, and each comment it answers is marked incorporated when it merges."
